# Build context hygiene for `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile.* .` from
# the repository root. The proxy image only needs the Python source tree
# and packaging metadata; everything else inflates the build context and
# can leak local state (logs, caches, native bindings) into layers.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.git/
.github/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
bench-results/
.benchmarks/
copilot_autopilot_*.log
docker/
tests/
scripts/
bindings/
stepback-core/
wasm/
GROUNDING.md
100_STEPS.md
